dbus-cxx
------------------------------------------
DBus-cxx is a C++ implementation of the DBus protocol. DBus is a Linux-specific
RPC(remote procedure call) and IPC(inter-process communications) mechanism.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libdbus-cxx-devel-2.6.2-1bl1
  libdbus-cxx-glib2-2.6.2-1bl1
  libdbus-cxx2-2.6.2-1bl1
  libexpat1-2.10.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libpopt0-1.19-1
  libsigc3.0-devel-3.0.3-1
  libsigc3.0_0-3.0.3-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  dbus-x11-1.16.2-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libdbus1-devel-1.16.2-1
  libexpat-devel-2.10.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libpopt-devel-1.19-1
  libsigc3.0-devel-3.0.3-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/dbus-cxx/dbus-cxx/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/dbus-cxx/dbus-cxx/archive/2.6.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack dbus-cxx-2.6.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./dbus-cxx-2.6.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/dbus-cxx-2.6.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/dbus-cxx-2.6.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdbus-cxx2-2.6.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdbus-cxx-devel-2.6.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdbus-cxx-glib2-2.6.2-X.tar.xz

